Material Symbols variable fonts and codepoint tables
====================================================

Files:
- MaterialSymbolsOutlined[FILL,GRAD,opsz,wght].ttf
- MaterialSymbolsRounded[FILL,GRAD,opsz,wght].ttf
- MaterialSymbolsSharp[FILL,GRAD,opsz,wght].ttf
- outlined.rs / rounded.rs / sharp.rs (generated codepoint constants)

Source: https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
License: Apache License 2.0
Copyright 2022 Google LLC

Variable font axis ranges (official):
  FILL 0..1, GRAD -50..200, opsz 20..48, wght 100..700
See https://developers.google.com/fonts/docs/material_symbols
